OwnTracks app logins (Settings > Connection; Mode: HTTP). The map is at https://{{ obcell_link_host }}:{{ owntracks_https_port }}/ (operator login).

URL, pick one:
{% if owntracks_funnel %}
  https://{{ obcell_tailnet_name }}:{{ owntracks_funnel_port }}/pub   anywhere with internet (public, Let's Encrypt certificate)
{% endif %}
{% if obcell_tailnet_name %}
  https://{{ obcell_tailnet_name }}:{{ owntracks_https_port }}/pub   phones on the tailnet (Tailscale app)
{% endif %}
  https://{{ obcell_lan_ip }}:{{ owntracks_https_port }}/pub   on the LAN or the cell (the phone must trust ~/openlive/openlive-root-ca.crt)

Identification: Username and Password below. Device ID: anything that names the phone (e.g. "pixel"). Tracker ID: two letters for the map.

{% for u in owntracks_users %}
  user: {{ u.name }}  password: {{ lookup('ansible.builtin.file', obcell_secrets_dir ~ '/owntracks_' ~ u.name ~ '_password') }}
{% endfor %}
